BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:2026 Job & Resource Fair
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261028T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261028T140000
UID:e5b3a73d73149bd90000a48bfbd7defc@growthzone.com
DESCRIPTION:The 2026 Job & Resource Fair will take place on Wednesday\, Oc
 tober 28\, 2026 from 11:00 – 2:00pm at the Sonoma County Fairgrounds in 
 Santa Rosa\, CA. The purpose of the Job & Resource Fair is to assist our u
 nsheltered and at risk population in finding employment and connecting wit
 h services which promote their well-being in order to do so. Applications 
 are currently being accepted for employers\, resource providers\, voluntee
 rs\, and sponsors interested in hosting a table or participating during th
 e event. The online application may be completed at the following link. ht
 tps://www.surveymonkey.com/r/F7BVC9X. For more information\, including the
  official event flyer\, participant details\, sponsorship levels or other 
 inquiries\, please contact Andrew.Akufo@sonomacounty.gov.
URL:https://business.sebastopol.org/events/details/2026-job-resource-fair
X-SOURCE:Sebastopol Chamber of Commerce
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Masters of Hawaiian Music: George Kahumoku Jr\, Led Kaapana\, Jeff
  Peterson
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261010T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261010T213000
UID:b1e6fe3b867af23583dd26ed8398f877@growthzone.com
DESCRIPTION:Experience the soulful sounds and rich traditions of Hawai‘i
  with three legendary masters of slack key guitar—George Kahumoku Jr.\, 
 Led Kaapana\, and Jeff Peterson. Rooted in the 19th-century paniolo (Hawai
 ian cowboy) culture\, slack key is a uniquely Hawaiian open-tuning guitar 
 style passed down through generations. These three acclaimed musicians bri
 ng together decades of tradition\, storytelling\, and virtuosic musiciansh
 ip.
URL:https://business.sebastopol.org/events/details/masters-of-hawaiian-mus
 ic-george-kahumoku-jr-led-kaapana-jeff-peterson
X-SOURCE:Sebastopol Chamber of Commerce
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Blind Scream Haunted House
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261009T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261031T230000
UID:ea23383d1eed1ba867a07a1a30d608f5@growthzone.com
DESCRIPTION:Open 13 nights only\, join the Doc and his family and step int
 o over 20\,000 square feet of haunted horror in the heart of Santa Rosa. T
 his year we have 2 distinct haunts for you to sink your teeth into. Blind 
 Scream Haunted House features the all new Caverns of Carnage where winding
  tunnels\, claustrophobic chambers\, and forgotten caverns have danger lur
 king around every corner. The deeper you go\, the harder it becomes to tel
 l what’s part of the cave and what’s watching you from within it. BLAC
 KOUT Haunted House is a pitch-black maze. All you have to guide your way i
 s one glow stick… and the creatures stalking your every step. Every sens
 e will be tested. Every turn is a challenge. And one wrong move… the scr
 eam is yours. Feed your terrors today and get your tickets before it's too
  late. Once the 13 nights are gone\, the haunt disappears until next year!
  Location - 98 Santa Rosa Plaza\, Downtown Santa Rosa (at the corners of 1
 st Street and A Street). South of the Santa Rosa Plaza parking ga
URL:https://business.sebastopol.org/events/details/blind-scream-haunted-ho
 use
X-SOURCE:Sebastopol Chamber of Commerce
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Santa Rosa Zombie Crawl
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261010T170000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261010T230000
UID:88d21dd558a3a9714de6251504839e78@growthzone.com
DESCRIPTION:The undead will rise for a night of eerie eats\, creepy cockta
 ils\, and bloodcurdling fun at the Santa Rosa Zombie Crawl on Saturday\, O
 ctober 10! Starting at Blind Scream Haunted House between 5–5:30 PM\, zo
 mbies will collect their wristbands and treasure maps before staggering of
 f on a fright-filled adventure. Along the way\, crawlers can sip and snack
  on ghastly specials from some of the best bars and restaurants Downtown S
 anta Rosa has to offer. To finish off your crawl\, drag your bones back to
  Blind Scream Haunted House before 9:30 PM for VIP entry into both haunted
  houses — including the pitch-dark terror of The Blackout. If you’re s
 till undead after that\, keep the night alive with a nightcap. Participati
 ng establishments will be announced soon. Costumes are highly encouraged
 … after all\, what’s a crawl without a creepy crowd? Join us for a nig
 ht to dismember! This is a 21 years of age or older event.
URL:https://business.sebastopol.org/events/details/santa-rosa-zombie-crawl
X-SOURCE:Sebastopol Chamber of Commerce
END:VEVENT
