DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261016T213000
UID:ad5454e4c77952535398796fcb8c566b@growthzone.com
DESCRIPTION:Sebastopol’s resident burlesque dancer Velvet Thorn is going
  to Japan this November! She needs your help to get to Kobe for the Japan 
 International Burlesque Festival. What better way to raise some support fo
 r her travels than doing what she knows best: putting on a show! On Octobe
 r 16th at The Main Street Theater Sebastopol\, enjoy an evening of burlesq
 ue performances from artists across the Bay Area! There will also be a cos
 tume sale in the lobby and Velvet Thorn merch available. Velvet has been p
 roducing burlesque shows for over a year across SOCO. If you have enjoyed 
 any productions from Epineux Productions or come to support her at another
  local show\, or you are interested to see what burlesque is all about dro
 p by for an evening of community fun! Lobby opens at 6:45pm\, Theater open
 s at 7:00pm\, and Show at 7:30pm
URL:https://business.sebastopol.org/events/details/velvet-s-mini-burlesque
 -variety-show
X-SOURCE:Sebastopol Chamber of Commerce
